        "radius": 24,
        "tab_radius": 14
      },
      "blocks": {
        "arc_170": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Orders",
            "icon": "lucide-truck",
            "anchor_id": "orders",
            "content": "<h3>When will my order ship?</h3><p>Orders placed before 2 pm ET on business days ship the same day. Delivery takes 2 to 4 business days in the US.</p><h3>Can I change my address?</h3><p>Yes, until the order is packed. Reply to your confirmation email or message us with the order number.</p><h3>Do you ship internationally?</h3><p>We ship to 38 countries. Duties are calculated at checkout so there are no surprises on delivery.</p>"
          }
        },
        "arc_171": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Returns",
            "icon": "lucide-undo-2",
            "anchor_id": "returns",
            "content": "<h3>How does the 30-day fit trial work?</h3><p>Use your objects for up to 30 days. If they are not right, start a return and we email a prepaid label.</p><h3>When do refunds arrive?</h3><p>Refunds are issued the day your return is scanned at our warehouse and take 3 to 5 business days to appear.</p><h3>Can I exchange a color?</h3><p>Yes. Choose Exchange when you start the return and we ship the new finish as soon as the label is scanned.</p>"
          }
        },
        "arc_172": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Warranty",
            "icon": "lucide-shield",
            "anchor_id": "warranty",
            "content": "<h3>What does the warranty cover?</h3><p>Two years against defects in materials and workmanship, including batteries that drop below 80% capacity.</p><h3>How do I start a repair?</h3><p>Use the support form below and choose Warranty and repair. We reply with a prepaid shipping label.</p><h3>Do you repair out-of-warranty items?</h3><p>Yes. Hinges, bands, straps and batteries are repaired at a flat fee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "arc_173": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Pairing",
            "icon": "lucide-headphones",
            "anchor_id": "pairing",
            "content": "<h3>How do I pair Vector glasses?</h3><p>Open the temples, hold the button for 5 seconds until the light pulses, then select Vector in your phone's Bluetooth list.</p><h3>Is there an app?</h3><p>The ARC//FORM app is optional and adds button remapping and firmware updates.</p><h3>Why does audio cut out?</h3><p>Keep your phone within 10 meters and update to the latest firmware from the app.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
